# Breed & Raid — scope lock

## Build in PROVE

Plots≥2 · nests+MPS+Collect · creature roll with **oneIn** · breed/hatch · steal/lock/bat · thin block build.

## Do NOT build in PROVE

- Robux / GamePasses live
- Rebirth, offline earnings, trading
- Night/monster (Night Raid)
- Global LB, season BP, full luck economy polish
- Unique mesh per hybrid — use gene look pipeline (GDD §4)

## Rules

- GDD wins over chat guesses.
- `oneIn` is primary flex on billboards/UI.
- Buy block = +100.
- Always-day.
- Mark `docs/DEV_TRACKER.md` after work.
